=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Guttrix}, who will offer to make you Race Specific Equipment (RSE) if you bring him a {@k} {k:Magical pattern}.
** {@k} {k:Magical patterns|Magical pattern} are found in {p:Treasure Chests|Category:Treasure Chest} in {z:Gusgen Mines}, {z:Ordelle's Caves}, and {z:Maze of Shakhrami}.
** You need to find the chests at the right time. Treasure maps for the zones are below (blue squares are chest spawns).
** Alternately, adventurers in possession of the {@k} {k:"Rhapsody in White"} can purchase these keys for 2,500g from a {p:Curio Vendor Moogle}.
* Each race is given a game week ({p:Firesday} to {p:Darksday}) to find a pattern. At the end of that game week, it will become the next race's turn.
** The race order is {p:Hume Male} > {p:Hume Female} > {p:Elvaan Male} > {p:Elvaan Female} > {p:Tarutaru Male} > {p:Tarutaru Female} > {p:Mithra} > {p:Galka}.
** Each game week is 7 hours 40 minutes 48 seconds, meaning about every 8 hours the pattern changes.
** The following sites provide RSE calendar details:
*** {p:https://www.mithrapride.org/vana_time/}
*** {p:https://www.pyogenes.com/ffxi/timer/v2.html}
** You must open the treasure chest when it is your race's week or you will not get the pattern.
** You may only have one pattern on you at a time. However, there is no limit to the number of patterns you may re-obtain (as long as it is within your RSE week).
* Turn the pattern into {n:Guttrix}, who will give you the option to craft it into one of the following four (4) armors:

